      "sourceSpeaker": "28240",
      "utterance": "20180910-0900-PLENARY-en_20180910-18:32:46_13",
      "text": "The fact that young people are ready to do that, and that we enable them to do it and to develop their capacities, reflects a good European attitude.",
      "licence": "CC0-1.0",
      "durationMs": 8360,
      "sha256": "89dfae183487e9cada31901af933baafe15fcb33c4a740818207e21e680c2ad0"
