      "sourceSpeaker": "96920",
      "utterance": "20120215-0900-PLENARY-17-en_20120215-22:10:23_1",
      "text": "I am aware of all the different systems, but I guess my real concern here is that there is not one size that has to fit all.",
      "licence": "CC0-1.0",
      "durationMs": 6179,
      "sha256": "aa4e7b5ef717164c35fb9e5d93b474e262e32ad2f248b3463b6ad8d40b47ef8f"
    },
    {
      "id": "en-f2-2",
      "file": "clips/en-f2-2.wav",
      "speaker": "en-f2",
      "lang": "en",
      "gender": "female",
      "source": "VoxPopuli, transcribed test split (facebook/voxpopuli)",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/facebook/voxpopuli",
      "sourceSpeaker": "96920",
      "utterance": "20130910-0900-PLENARY-9-en_20130910-13:26:25_1",
      "text": "My own first language, Welsh, has a long history, over centuries, of not being allowed to be used in public discourse, yet has always managed to survive and indeed is now used with equivalent status to English in the Welsh Assembly.",
      "licence": "CC0-1.0",
      "durationMs": 11778,
      "sha256": "79e84ce15b306429428329e0159bdc3f03270d68f14604dc93283c826c034586"
    },
    {
      "id": "en-f2-3",
