      "text": "However, I personally believe that we could have been even more ambitious in this proposal and, indeed, with the Capital Markets Union project as a whole, as this is an area in which our level of achievement does not so far seem to match up to our rhetoric.",
      "licence": "CC0-1.0",
      "durationMs": 12498,
      "sha256": "e4add98d89d953ea5770370e82ba80e83337f1fab740de05ecaa7692478c47f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "en-f2-4",
      "file": "clips/en-f2-4.wav",
