      "sourceSpeaker": "96920",
      "utterance": "20120215-0900-PLENARY-17-en_20120215-22:10:23_2",
      "text": "We can find different ways of doing this, and where Member States have got effective systems in place and there are many Member States which do we need to take into account the fact that their systems work effectively.",
      "licence": "CC0-1.0",
      "durationMs": 10639,
